# No arXiv API (CUHK rate limits)

Shared CUHK egress hits arXiv rate limits when many users run this CLI. **Do not
query `export.arxiv.org` / the arXiv Atom API.**

## Required

- Fetch paper lists and validate arXiv ids via **INSPIRE-HEP only**
  (`_inspire_query_retry`, `_inspire_get_by_arxiv_id`, `_inspire_query`).
- Do not call `_arxiv_query`, restore arXiv-first fallbacks, or add new
  `https://export.arxiv.org/...` requests.
- `https://arxiv.org/abs/...` (and pdf) links in stored records / display are fine;
  those are user-facing URLs, not API traffic.

## Examples

```python
# ❌ BAD — hits arXiv API
entries = _arxiv_query({"search_query": f"id:{paper_id}", ...})

# ✅ GOOD — INSPIRE only
entry = _inspire_get_by_arxiv_id(paper_id)
entries = _inspire_query_retry(inspire_q, limit)
```
